 "neat_config_text": "# Cox survival runs (experiments/survival/run_seed.py). Derived from\n# experiments/10seed/configs/heart.ini: weights and biases are learned by\n# backprop (weight/bias mutation off), topology by NEAT. num_inputs is\n# overwritten by the runner with the number of model columns.\n# fitness = -(Efron Cox loss) - AIC parsimony penalty, always negative (the\n# null model scores about -5 to -7), so fitness_threshold = 999 never\n# triggers: runs stop on generations. The output activation is identity (set\n# by the runner, recorded in config_json[\"training\"] in DB mode).\n# weight_init_stdev = 0.1 (protocol v3; heart.ini has 1.0): new connections start\n# at Cox-coefficient scale (|log-HR per SD| is typically < 1) instead of a large\n# random perturbation that 5 backprop epochs per generation cannot undo.\n[NEAT]\npop_size = 250\nfitness_criterion = max\nfitness_threshold = 999.0\nreset_on_extinction = False\n\n\n[DefaultGenome]\nactivation_default = relu\nactivation_mutate_rate = 0.0\nactivation_options = relu\naggregation_default = sum\naggregation_mutate_rate = 0.0\naggregation_options = sum\nbias_init_mean = 0.0\nbias_init_stdev = 1.0\nbias_max_value = 30.0\nbias_min_value = -30.0\nbias_mutate_power = 0.0\nbias_mutate_rate = 0.0\nbias_replace_rate = 0.0\ncompatibility_disjoint_coefficient = 1.0\ncompatibility_weight_coefficient = 0.5\nconn_add_prob = 0.5\nconn_delete_prob = 0.3\nenabled_default = True\nenabled_mutate_rate = 0.1\nfeed_forward = True\ninitial_connection = full_direct\nnode_add_prob = 0.4\nnode_delete_prob = 0.2\nnum_hidden = 0\nnum_inputs = 14\nnum_outputs = 1\nresponse_init_mean = 1.0\nresponse_init_stdev = 0.0\nresponse_max_value = 30.0\nresponse_min_value = -30.0\nresponse_mutate_power = 0.0\nresponse_mutate_rate = 0.0\nresponse_replace_rate = 0.0\nweight_init_mean = 0.0\nweight_init_stdev = 0.1\nweight_max_value = 30.0\nweight_min_value = -30.0\nweight_mutate_power = 0.0\nweight_mutate_rate = 0.0\nweight_replace_rate = 0.0\n\n[DefaultSpeciesSet]\ncompatibility_threshold = 3.0\n\n[DefaultStagnation]\nspecies_fitness_func = max\nmax_stagnation = 15\nspecies_elitism = 2\n\n[DefaultReproduction]\nelitism = 2\nsurvival_threshold = 0.2\n",
